{%- doc -%}
  32px line icon for a theme-defined product highlight. Drawn to match the grey
  (#7d7d7d) highlight icons uploaded to Files, so theme and metaobject highlights
  sit side by side. Unknown names fall back to a tick in a circle.

  @param {string} name - Icon name, e.g. "lightweight", "gauge", "waterproof"

  @example
  {% render 'product-highlight-icon', name: 'gauge' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

